      "text": "REVIEWED SCENARIO\nMISSISSAUGA / 05\nCooksville\nA meeting point for transit, housing and health care\nThe completed 32-storey Alba at Fairview joins\nCooksville’s existing context. Proposals cluster\naround Cooksville GO, Hurontario and Dundas. The\n34-storey model at 51-55 Dundas West follows\nsubmitted plans and retains the heritage building.\nMODEL LIMIT\nAlba follows approved plans with approximate details.\nCooksville GO uses Arup’s supplied Step 4 geometry for seven\ntowers, podiums and roofs. Terrain integration remains\napproximate; this proposal does not establish approval or\nconstruction.\nAlba approved plans\nCooksville GO TOC\n51-55 Dundas plans\nHospital project\nPlan source\nFUTURE MISSISSAUGA\nVISUAL POLISH / 26 SEPTEMBER 2026\n22\n"
